IDoc splitter ->
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
An IDoc Splitter in SAP CPI (Cloud Platform Integration) is a component that breaks down a composite
IDoc message into individual IDocs. It's used when you need to process a bulk IDoc message,
containing multiple individual IDocs, as separate entities.

The Idoc splitter is used to split SAP IDoc messages into individual segments or sub-documents.
-> It allows for the separation and processing of individual segments or sub-documents within IDoc messages.

